                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                <string key="text">This eggplant salad is a delicious blend of warm roasted eggplant and fresh, raw vegetables. It combines the rich, tender texture of the eggplant with the bright, juicy acidity of tomatoes, the sharp crunch of onions, and the light, crisp texture of green leaves. It's a satisfying mix of earthy and fresh flavors that feels both hearty and healthy.</string>
